 car","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"as he had got into the car","g":"状语从句"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"As soon as he had got into the car","g":"副词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["原因状语从句","过去分词作定语/状语","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":8,"t":44.39,"t2":47.36,"en":"I said good morning to him in French","zh":"我就用法语向他问早上好，","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"said morning","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"to him","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in French","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":9,"t":47.36,"t2":51.76,"en":"and he replied in the same language.","zh":"他也同样用法语回答我。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"in the same language","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the same language","g":"冠词+形+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型","并列结构"]},{"i":10,"t":51.76,"t2":54.03,"en":"Apart from a few words,","zh":"除了个别几个单词外，","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"from a few words","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a few words","g":"冠词+形+名"}],"pat":"非完整句（碎片/解析待核）","gp":[]},{"i":11,"t":54.03,"t2":57.36,"en":"I do not know any French at all.","zh":"我根本不会法语。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"do not know French all","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"at all","g":"副词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"any French","g":"名词作定语/专名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["否定的 not","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":12,"t":57.36,"t2":61.28,"en":"Neither of us spoke during the journey.","zh":"旅途中我们谁也没讲话。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"during the journey","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of us","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the journey","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","否定 neither","either/neither 并列"]},{"i":13,"t":61.28,"t2":64.21,"en":"I had nearly reached the town,","zh":"我快要到达那个镇时，","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"had nearly reached town","g":"完成时态谓语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the town","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["过去完成时","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":14,"t":64.21,"t2":69.85,"en":"when the young man suddenly said, very slowly,","zh":"那青年人突然非常缓慢地开了口：","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"when suddenly said slowly","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"very slowly","g":"副词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the young man","g":"冠词+形+名"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般过去时","主谓+状